<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I just wanted to remind you that we have our next [<b>Masters without Arizona teacher certification</b>] Graduate Information Session coming up [<b>this week/next week</b>]. &nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">This will be an online information session, and takes place tomorrow, [<b>Tuesday, September 16th, from 5:30pm-7:30pm</b>]. &nbsp;This is the best way for you to gather important information about the program, and ensure you get your questions answered.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please take the time to<span id="docs-internal-guid-0a673071-d78e-8d41-fe76-6a3088d32358"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><a href="http://education.asu.edu/resources/events" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">register</span></a><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></span>for this event and reserve a spot for yourself.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I look forward to having you join the session. &nbsp;If you have any questions or concerns please feel free to contact me!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Kindest regards,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="randy.crawford@asu.edu">Randy Crawford</a> &nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Student Outreach Coordinator &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div><font><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font> | <font color="#ffcc33">Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College</font></b></font></font></div><div><font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">randy.crawford@asu.edu &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></font></div><div><font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">602-496-0124 |&nbsp;</font></font><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">fax: 602-543-6199 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</font></font><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </font><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
